  <title>Ajude escrevendo a documentação</title>

  <p>The GNOME Games user help is maintained by a volunteer community. You are
  welcome to participate.</p>

<p>Para contribuir para a Documentação do Projeto, sinta-se à vontade para falar conosco através de <link href="https://matrix.to/#/#docs:gnome.org">#docs:gnome.org</link> na <link xref="help:gnome-help/help-matrix">Matrix</link> ou <link href="https://web.libera.chat/#gnome-docs">#gnome-docs</link> na irc.libera.chat, ou via <link href="https://discourse.gnome.org/tag/documentation">GNOME Discourse</link>.</p>

  <p>Our
  <link href="https://wiki.gnome.org/DocumentationProject/Contributing">wiki</link>
  page contains useful information.</p>

